        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A PE certificate shall be generated using a certificate chain that uses a PE private root CA certificate as the trust anchor. Refer to Annex H for further details. Refer to H.1.6 for examples of certificate structure. Refer to Annex B for details of the certificate profile.",
