        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Some certificates are needed for the functioning of this document. This subclause defines the minimum certificates required both in the SECC and the EVCC that allows basic communication to function. The basic function is defined as being able to setup the communication and utilize EIM for authorization of services. This subclause does not cover requirements for the private SECC.",
            "block_bbox": [
